    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d287-a3">

                <pb facs="0690" n="576" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg576"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 3—Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The British Foreign Secretary</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Eden</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the British Acting
                        Consul General at Tangier</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Watkinson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-08-09">August 9, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I approve your decision to have no further meeting with the Italians until you
                    receive instructions which I hope to send you shortly.</p>
                <p>2. For your own guidance, our position is that we must insist on unconditional
                    surrender before we name our terms.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
